{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07305","headline":"出丰县界寄韩明府 · 刘长卿","name":"出丰县界寄韩明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回首古原上，未能辞旧乡。\n西风收暮雨，隐隐分芒砀。\n贤友此爲邑，令名满徐方。\n音容想在眼，暂若升琴堂。\n疲马顾春草，行人看夕阳。\n自非传尺素，谁爲论中肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}